4.4.2 ABSTRACT- AND OBJECT-LEVEL DEPENDENCIES
Abstract-level dependency indicates the dependency between an outer transaction and its inner trans-
actions at an abstract level. We define the dependency level (DL) as the number of inner transactions
that will execute OnAbort when the outer transactions abort. For example, T 1 illustrated in Figure 4.5
